-- Ag.seg: Setzer (APAL 92, 1998), Section 4.4, distinguished sets and
-- classes: Definition 4.18 - Lemma 4.24, pp. 146-147.  The mirror is
-- tools/otag.py; every statement was tested on it first (lem 6: 66
-- distinguished sets, 438 instances of 4.23(b), 2145 of 4.24, 269047 of the
-- transfer lemma; no failures).
--
-- Definition 4.18 (A, B classes):
--   Ag(A) = A c OT and A [= W(A)                                   Ag
--     (A [= B (Def. 4.12, WA.Seg) already contains A c OT.)
--   Prog(A, B) = for x in A, A n x c B => x in B                   Prog
--   Prog(B) = Prog(Omega_1, B), Omega_1 the class OT n Omega_1     Prog1
--   A+ = U_{z in A} ((W(A) n z+) u {z+})                           Aplus
-- Remark 4.19.  (a) A+ is a class of the level of A (the type of Aplus).
--   (b) A = A', B = B' => A [= B gives A' [= B' (seg-eqv), Ag(A) gives
--   Ag(A') (ag-eqv, by 4.13(c)), Prog(A, B) gives Prog(A', B') (prog-eqv;
--   Prog(B) <-> Prog(B') is the instance A = A' = Omega_1), A+ = A'+
--   (aplus-eqv, by 4.13(c)).
-- Remark 4.20.  a in A, Ag(A) => tau^A(a) = A n a.                 rem420
--   A n a c C^a(A) n a = tau^A(a) (4.7(h)).  a in A c W(A), so
--   tau^A(a) c W(A) n a (4.13(a)) = A n a (A [= W(A)).
-- Lemma 4.21.  Assume Ag(A).
--   (a) Prog(A, B) => A c B                                        rem421a
--   (b) A n Omega_1 [= OT                                          rem421b
--   (c) Prog(B) => A n Omega_1 c B                                 rem421c
--   (a) By Ind(x in W(A)) (Notation 4.11) of "x in A => x in B": for
--   x in A, A n x = tau^A(x) (4.20) c {y | y in A => y in B}, so A n x c B,
--   and x in B by Prog(A, B).  A c W(A) gives A c B.
--   (b) A n Omega_1 [= W(A) n Omega_1 (seg-cap) [= OT (4.13(d)): [= is
--   transitive (seg-trans).
--   (c) Setzer: "Prog(Omega_1, B) gives Prog(A n Omega_1, B), and by
--   A n Omega_1 [= Omega_1, A n Omega_1 c B" -- (a) needs Ag(A n Omega_1),
--   which is Lemma 4.28(b), later.  Instead (a) for A itself with
--   B' = {y | y <' Omega_1 => y in B}: let x in A, A n x c B', x <' Omega_1.
--   An y in OT n Omega_1 n x is in A by (b), so in B' and in B; by
--   Prog(Omega_1, B), x in B.  So A c B', i.e. A n Omega_1 c B.
-- Notation 4.22 ("by Ind(x in A)") is 4.21(a); no declaration.
-- Lemma 4.23.  Assume Ag(A).
--   (a) A is downward closed and upward closed bounded by A       rem423a
--   (b) k, c in A, k in R, c in C_k(c) => psi_k c in A             rem423b
--   (c) Ag(A+), A c A+, x in A => x+ in A+                         rem423c
--   Reading of (a).  "Bounded by A" with the class A as the bound C of
--   Def. 4.14(d) (z in C) is trivial: z in A gives z in A.  The bound is
--   Dn(A) = {z | z <=' c for some c in A}  (Dn); otag.py tests it.
--   For k in A: A n k = W(A) n k (A [= W(A)), A c W(A) c M(A), so 4.17(b)
--   applies at k (ag-h17): W(A) n k+ is downward closed and upward closed
--   bounded by k+.
--   (a) Downward closed: Clos.dc-below with D_x = W(A) n x+: x in it, and
--   y in W(A), y <=' x in A gives y in A (ag-back).  Upward closed: for
--   x, y in A and z = x + y, phi_x y, Omega_x, x+ with z <=' c in A, take
--   k in A above x, y, c (mx3: k = max, by trichotomy); x, y in W(A) n k+,
--   z <=' c <=' k <' k+, so z in W(A) n k+ (4.17(b)), and z <=' c in A
--   gives z in A.  0 <=' c: 0 in W(A) (4.17(a)); I <=' c: I in W(A) n c+.
--   (b) z = max{k, c} in A (max2).  W(A) n z~ = A n z~ (z~ <=' z in A),
--   so psi_k c in W(A) by 4.17(c); psi_k c <' k in A, so psi_k c in A.
--   (c) A c A+ (x in W(A) n x+), x+ in A+ by definition.  A+ c OT.
--   Setzer: "A n x~ = W(A) n x~ = A+ n x~, A+ n x+ = W(A) n x+ = W(A+) n x+,
--   ..., x+ in W(A+)".  The step W(A) n x+ = W(A+) n x+ is 4.13(b) and the
--   step x+ in W(A+) is 4.17(b) for A+; both need A+ c M(A+), which is not
--   said and is proved first:
--     z in A => z+ in M(A) (up-M): A n z+ is weakly downward closed by (a),
--     so C^{z+}(A) is upward closed (4.16(a)); z in A n z+ c C^{z+}(A)
--     (4.7(h)), so z+ in C^{z+}(A).  So A+ c W(A) u {z+ | z in A} c M(A),
--     and M(A) c M(A+) since A c A+ (m-mono, 4.7 by ca-mono).
--   Let x in A.
--     A+ n x+ = W(A) n x+ (ap-cap): an element z+ <' x+ with z in A is
--     <=' x~ (card-below: a cardinal below x+ is <=' x~), x~ in A by (a),
--     so z+ in A (A upward closed bounded by Dn(A)) c W(A).
--     A n x~ = A+ n x~ (til-eq): y in A+ n x~ is in W(A) n x+, and
--     y <' x~ <=' x in A, so y in A.  x~ = Omega_s, x+ = Omega_{s+1}
--     (2.14(f)), so W(A) n x+ = W(A+) n x+ by 4.13(b) (wap).
--     Hence A+ n x+ = W(A+) n x+ (ap-cap2): 4.17(b) holds for A+ at x+, and
--     W(A+) n x++ is upward closed bounded by x++; x in W(A+) n x++ gives
--     x+ in W(A+) (ap-wup).  So y <=' x+ => (y in A+ <=> y in W(A+)) (ap-le).
--   Every z in A+ is <=' x+ for an x in A, so A+|z = W(A+)|z: Ag(A+).
--
-- Lemma 4.24.  A_i = W(A_i) n a_i (i = 0, 1), a_0 <=' a_1, a_i in OT
-- =>  A_0 = A_1 n a_0.                                             rem424
--   (a_i in OT is added: the comparisons y <' x <' a_i need it.)
--   Transfer (wa-at): A, B c OT, z in OT, A n z = B n z, x in W(A),
--   x <=' z => x in W(B).  WA.wa-agree with P = {x | x <=' z}: for x <=' z,
--   A n x = B n x (cap-le), so C^x(A) = C^x(B) (ca-mono both ways; no
--   A c M(A) needed); y in tau^A(x) gives y <' x <=' z.
--   A_i [= W(A_i) (eq-ag), so 4.21(a) is the induction on A_i.
--   Side (side): b in OT, b <=' a_0, A_0 n b c A_1 => A_1 n b c A_0.
--   By 4.21(a) on A_1 with {z | z <' b => z in A_0}: let z in A_1,
--   A_1 n z c A_0 (induction, since z <' b), A_0 n z c A_1 (z <' b), so
--   A_0 n z = A_1 n z; z in W(A_1) gives z in W(A_0) (transfer), z <' b <=' a_0,
--   so z in A_0.
--   Main: A_0 c A_1, by 4.21(a) on A_0: x in A_0, A_0 n x c A_1 gives
--   A_1 n x c A_0 (side at b = x), so A_0 n x = A_1 n x, x in W(A_1)
--   (transfer), x <' a_0 <=' a_1: x in A_1.  Then A_1 n a_0 c A_0 is the
--   side at b = a_0.
--   Setzer first reduces to a_0 = a_1 (replacing A_1 by A_1 n a_0, which
--   needs Remark 4.19(b) and A_1 n a_0 = W(A_1 n a_0) n a_0); with the side
--   stated for every bound b this is not needed, and the side at a_0 is the
--   "similarly A_1 c A_0" of his proof.
level gl ;
import OT ;
import OTLaws ;
import OTTrans ;
import OTC ;
import OTF ;
import CA ;
import WA ;
import Clos ;
import Lem417 ;
open OT ;
open OTLaws[gl] ;
open OTTrans[gl] ;
open OTC[gl] ;
open OTF[gl] ;
open CA[gl] ;
open WA[gl] ;
open Clos[gl] ;
open Lem417[gl] ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Definition 4.18

Ag (A : Cl) : U gl = Seg A (WA[gl].WA A) ;
Prog (A B : Cl) : U gl = (x : T) -> A x -> Sub (Cap A x) B -> B x ;
Prog1 (B : Cl) : U gl = Prog (Cap OTc (om one)) B ;
Aplus (A : Cl) (y : T) : U gl = (z : T) * (A z * Or (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up z) y) (Id T y (up z))) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Segments

-- x in A, A [= B  =>  x in B
seg-in (A B : Cl) (s : Seg A B) (x : T) (a : A x) : B x =
  (fw (Bar A x x) (Bar B x x) (s.2 x a x) (a, lt-suc-self x (s.1 x a))).1 ;
-- x in A, y in B, y <' x+1, A [= B  =>  y in A
seg-dn (A B : Cl) (s : Seg A B) (x y : T) (a : A x) (b : B y) (l : LT y (suc x)) : A y =
  (bw (Bar A x y) (Bar B x y) (s.2 x a y) (b, l)).1 ;

-- A [= B  =>  A n c [= B n c
seg-cap (A B : Cl) (c : T) (s : Seg A B) : Seg (Cap A c) (Cap B c) =
  (\ x a -> s.1 x a.1,
   \ x a y -> (\ q -> (((fw (Bar A x y) (Bar B x y) (s.2 x a.1 y) (q.1.1, q.2)).1, q.1.2), q.2),
               \ q -> (((bw (Bar A x y) (Bar B x y) (s.2 x a.1 y) (q.1.1, q.2)).1, q.1.2), q.2))) ;

-- A [= B [= D  =>  A [= D
seg-trans (A B D : Cl) (s1 : Seg A B) (s2 : Seg B D) : Seg A D =
  (s1.1,
   \ x a y -> (\ q -> fw (Bar B x y) (Bar D x y) (s2.2 x (seg-in A B s1 x a) y) (fw (Bar A x y) (Bar B x y) (s1.2 x a y) q),
               \ q -> bw (Bar A x y) (Bar B x y) (s1.2 x a y) (bw (Bar B x y) (Bar D x y) (s2.2 x (seg-in A B s1 x a) y) q))) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Remark 4.19 (b)

seg-eqv (A A' B B' : Cl) (eA : Eqv A A') (eB : Eqv B B') (s : Seg A B) : Seg A' B' =
  (\ x a -> s.1 x (bw (A x) (A' x) (eA x) a),
   \ x a y ->
     (\ q -> (fw (B y) (B' y) (eB y)
                (fw (Bar A x y) (Bar B x y) (s.2 x (bw (A x) (A' x) (eA x) a) y) (bw (A y) (A' y) (eA y) q.1, q.2)).1, q.2),
      \ q -> (fw (A y) (A' y) (eA y)
                (bw (Bar A x y) (Bar B x y) (s.2 x (bw (A x) (A' x) (eA x) a) y) (bw (B y) (B' y) (eB y) q.1, q.2)).1, q.2))) ;

ag-eqv (A A' : Cl) (e : Eqv A A') (g : Ag A) : Ag A' =
  seg-eqv A A' (WA[gl].WA A) (WA[gl].WA A') e (rem413c A A' e) g ;

prog-eqv (A A' B B' : Cl) (eA : Eqv A A') (eB : Eqv B B') (p : Prog A B) : Prog A' B' =
  \ x a h -> fw (B x) (B' x) (eB x)
               (p x (bw (A x) (A' x) (eA x) a)
                  (\ y q -> bw (B y) (B' y) (eB y) (h y (fw (A y) (A' y) (eA y) q.1, q.2)))) ;

aplus-sub (A A' : Cl) (e : Eqv A A') : Sub (Aplus A) (Aplus A') =
  \ y h -> (h.1, (fw (A h.1) (A' h.1) (e h.1) h.2.1,
                  either (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up h.1) y) (Id T y (up h.1))
                    (Or (Cap (WA[gl].WA A') (up h.1) y) (Id T y (up h.1)))
                    (\ q -> inl (fw (WA[gl].WA A y) (WA[gl].WA A' y) (rem413c A A' e y) q.1, q.2))
                    (\ q -> inr q) h.2.2)) ;

aplus-eqv (A A' : Cl) (e : Eqv A A') : Eqv (Aplus A) (Aplus A') =
  \ y -> (aplus-sub A A' e y, aplus-sub A' A (eqv-sym A A' e) y) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Distinguished sets: the parts of Ag(A)

ag-ot (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Sub A OTc = g.1 ;

-- A c W(A)
ag-w (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) : WA[gl].WA A x = seg-in A (WA[gl].WA A) g x ax ;

-- y <=' x  =>  y <' x+1
le-sx (y x : T) (oy : OK y) (ox : OK x) (l : Tr (le y x)) : LT y (suc x) =
  le-lt y x (suc x) (trOT y x (suc x) oy ox (suc-OK x ox)) l (lt-suc-self x ox) ;

-- y <' x  =>  y <' x+1
lt-sx (y x : T) (oy : OK y) (ox : OK x) (l : LT y x) : LT y (suc x) = le-sx y x oy ox (le-of-lt y x l) ;

-- y in W(A), y <=' x in A  =>  y in A
ag-back (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x y : T) (ax : A x) (wy : WA[gl].WA A y) (l : Tr (le y x)) : A y =
  seg-dn A (WA[gl].WA A) g x y ax wy (le-sx y x (wa-OK A y wy) (ag-ot A g x ax) l) ;

-- x in A  =>  A n x = W(A) n x
ag-cap (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) : Eqv (Cap A x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) x) =
  \ y -> (\ q -> (ag-w A g y q.1, q.2),
          \ q -> (ag-back A g x y ax q.1 (le-of-lt y x q.2), q.2)) ;

-- A c M(A)
ag-M (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Sub A (M A) = \ x ax -> wa-M A x (ag-w A g x ax) ;

-- k in A  =>  the hypotheses of Lemma 4.17(b) at k
ag-h17 (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (k : T) (ak : A k) : H17 A k = (ag-M A g, (ag-ot A g k ak, ag-cap A g k ak)) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Remark 4.20

rem420 (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (a : T) (aa : A a) : Eqv (tau A a) (Cap A a) =
  \ y -> (\ t -> (ag-back A g a y aa ((rem413a A a (ag-w A g a aa)).1 y t) (le-of-lt y a t.2), t.2),
          \ q -> (rem47h a A y (ag-ot A g y q.1) q, q.2)) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.21

-- the class {y | y in A => y in B}
Imp (A B : Cl) (y : T) : U gl = A y -> B y ;

-- (a) Prog(A, B) => A c B
rem421a (A B : Cl) (g : Ag A) (p : Prog A B) : Sub A B =
  \ x ax -> wa-ind A (Imp A B)
              (\ y w m ih ay -> p y ay (\ u q -> ih u (bw (tau A y u) (Cap A y u) (rem420 A g y ay u) q) q.1))
              x (ag-w A g x ax) ax ;

-- (b) A n Omega_1 [= OT
rem421b (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Seg (Cap A (om one)) OTc =
  seg-trans (Cap A (om one)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (om one)) OTc (seg-cap A (WA[gl].WA A) (om one) g) (rem413d A) ;

-- (c) Prog(B) => A n Omega_1 c B, by (a) with {y | y <' Omega_1 => y in B}
prog-low (A B : Cl) (g : Ag A) (p : Prog1 B) : Prog A (Imp (Bnd (om one)) B) =
  \ y ay h l ->
    p y (ag-ot A g y ay, l)
      (\ u r -> h u ((seg-dn (Cap A (om one)) OTc (rem421b A g) y u (ay, l) r.1.1
                         (lt-sx u y r.1.1 (ag-ot A g y ay) r.2)).1, r.2)
                  r.1.2) ;

rem421c (A B : Cl) (g : Ag A) (p : Prog1 B) : Sub (Cap A (om one)) B =
  \ x q -> rem421a A (Imp (Bnd (om one)) B) g (prog-low A B g p) x q.1 q.2 ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.23 (a)

-- the class {z | z <=' c for some c in A}
Dn (A : Cl) (z : T) : U gl = (c : T) * (A c * Tr (le z c)) ;

-- the parts of UC (accessors)
uc-sum (A Bd : Cl) (u : UC A Bd) : USum A Bd = u.1 ;
uc-phi (A Bd : Cl) (u : UC A Bd) : UPhi A Bd = u.2.1 ;
uc-om (A Bd : Cl) (u : UC A Bd) : UOm A Bd = u.2.2.1 ;
uc-up (A Bd : Cl) (u : UC A Bd) : UUp A Bd = u.2.2.2.1 ;
uc-0 (A Bd : Cl) (u : UC A Bd) : WU0 A Bd = u.2.2.2.2 ;

-- x in OT:  x+ in OT, x <' x+  (2.14(a), (f))
up-OK (x : T) (ox : OK x) : OK (up x) = (rem214a x ox).2.1 ;
lt-up (x : T) (ox : OK x) : LT x (up x) = (rem214f x ox).2.2.2.2.2 ;

-- z <=' c <=' k  =>  z <' k+
bnd-up (z c k : T) (oz : OK z) (oc : OK c) (ok : OK k) (l1 : Tr (le z c)) (l2 : Tr (le c k)) : LT z (up k) =
  le-lt z c (up k) (trOT z c (up k) oz oc (up-OK k ok)) l1
    (le-lt c k (up k) (trOT c k (up k) oc ok (up-OK k ok)) l2 (lt-up k ok)) ;

-- k in A  =>  W(A) n k+ is upward closed bounded by k+  (4.17(b))
ag-uck (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (k : T) (ak : A k) : UC (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up k)) (Bnd (up k)) =
  (rem417b A k (ag-h17 A g k ak)).2 ;

-- y in A, y <=' k  =>  y in W(A) n k+
ag-wk (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (k y : T) (ak : A k) (ay : A y) (l : Tr (le y k)) : Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up k) y =
  (ag-w A g y ay, le-lt y k (up k) (trOT y k (up k) (ag-ot A g y ay) (ag-ot A g k ak) (up-OK k (ag-ot A g k ak))) l
                    (lt-up k (ag-ot A g k ak))) ;

-- downward closed:  D_x = W(A) n x+  (Clos.dc-below)
ag-dc (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : DC A =
  dc-below A (\ x -> Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up x)) (ag-ot A g)
    (\ x ax -> (rem417b A x (ag-h17 A g x ax)).1)
    (\ x ax -> ag-wk A g x x ax ax (le-refl x))
    (\ x y ax q l -> ag-back A g x y ax q.1 l) ;

-- an element of A above x and y (trichotomy)
Mx (A : Cl) (x y : T) : U gl = (k : T) * (A k * (Tr (le x k) * Tr (le y k))) ;
max2 (A : Cl) (okA : Sub A OTc) (x y : T) (ax : A x) (ay : A y) : Mx A x y =
  boolCases (Mx A x y) (lt x y)
    (\ t -> (y, (ay, (le-of-lt x y t, le-refl y))))
    (\ f -> (x, (ax, (le-refl x, nlt-le y x (ot-T y (okA y ay)) (ot-T x (okA x ax)) f)))) ;

-- an element of A above x, y and c
Mx3 (A : Cl) (x y c : T) : U gl = (k : T) * (A k * (Tr (le x k) * (Tr (le y k) * Tr (le c k)))) ;
mx3-of (A : Cl) (okA : Sub A OTc) (x y c : T) (ax : A x) (ay : A y) (m : Mx A x y) (n : Mx A m.1 c) : Mx3 A x y c =
  (n.1, (n.2.1,
   (le-trans x m.1 n.1 (trOT x m.1 n.1 (okA x ax) (okA m.1 m.2.1) (okA n.1 n.2.1)) m.2.2.1 n.2.2.1,
    (le-trans y m.1 n.1 (trOT y m.1 n.1 (okA y ay) (okA m.1 m.2.1) (okA n.1 n.2.1)) m.2.2.2 n.2.2.1,
     n.2.2.2)))) ;
mx3 (A : Cl) (okA : Sub A OTc) (x y c : T) (ax : A x) (ay : A y) (ac : A c) : Mx3 A x y c =
  mx3-of A okA x y c ax ay (max2 A okA x y ax ay) (max2 A okA (max2 A okA x y ax ay).1 c (max2 A okA x y ax ay).2.1 ac) ;

-- the upward steps at k = max{x, y, c}:  z in W(A) n k+, z <=' c in A
us-at (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x y c : T) (ax : A x) (ay : A y) (ac : A c) (m : Mx3 A x y c)
  (o : OK (add x y)) (l : Tr (le (add x y) c)) : A (add x y) =
  ag-back A g c (add x y) ac
    ((uc-sum (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up m.1)) (Bnd (up m.1)) (ag-uck A g m.1 m.2.1) x y
        (ag-wk A g m.1 x m.2.1 ax m.2.2.1) (ag-wk A g m.1 y m.2.1 ay m.2.2.2.1) o
        (bnd-up (add x y) c m.1 o (ag-ot A g c ac) (ag-ot A g m.1 m.2.1) l m.2.2.2.2)).1) l ;
up-at (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x y c : T) (ax : A x) (ay : A y) (ac : A c) (m : Mx3 A x y c)
  (o : OK (phiF x y)) (l : Tr (le (phiF x y) c)) : A (phiF x y) =
  ag-back A g c (phiF x y) ac
    ((uc-phi (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up m.1)) (Bnd (up m.1)) (ag-uck A g m.1 m.2.1) x y
        (ag-wk A g m.1 x m.2.1 ax m.2.2.1) (ag-wk A g m.1 y m.2.1 ay m.2.2.2.1) o
        (bnd-up (phiF x y) c m.1 o (ag-ot A g c ac) (ag-ot A g m.1 m.2.1) l m.2.2.2.2)).1) l ;
uo-at (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x c : T) (ax : A x) (ac : A c) (m : Mx3 A x x c)
  (o : OK (omF x)) (l : Tr (le (omF x) c)) : A (omF x) =
  ag-back A g c (omF x) ac
    ((uc-om (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up m.1)) (Bnd (up m.1)) (ag-uck A g m.1 m.2.1) x
        (ag-wk A g m.1 x m.2.1 ax m.2.2.1) o
        (bnd-up (omF x) c m.1 o (ag-ot A g c ac) (ag-ot A g m.1 m.2.1) l m.2.2.2.2)).1) l ;
uu-at (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x c : T) (ax : A x) (ac : A c) (m : Mx3 A x x c)
  (o : OK (up x)) (l : Tr (le (up x) c)) : A (up x) =
  ag-back A g c (up x) ac
    ((uc-up (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up m.1)) (Bnd (up m.1)) (ag-uck A g m.1 m.2.1) x
        (ag-wk A g m.1 x m.2.1 ax m.2.2.1) o
        (bnd-up (up x) c m.1 o (ag-ot A g c ac) (ag-ot A g m.1 m.2.1) l m.2.2.2.2)).1) l ;
-- I <=' c in A: I in W(A) n c+
ui-at (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (c : T) (ac : A c) (l : Tr (le ii c)) : A ii =
  ag-back A g c ii ac
    ((uc-0 (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up c)) (Bnd (up c)) (ag-uck A g c ac)).2
       (bnd-up ii c c ok-ii (ag-ot A g c ac) (ag-ot A g c ac) l (le-refl c))).1 l ;

-- upward closed bounded by Dn(A)
ag-uc (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : UC A (Dn A) =
  (\ x y ax ay o d -> us-at A g x y d.1 ax ay d.2.1 (mx3 A (ag-ot A g) x y d.1 ax ay d.2.1) o d.2.2,
   (\ x y ax ay o d -> up-at A g x y d.1 ax ay d.2.1 (mx3 A (ag-ot A g) x y d.1 ax ay d.2.1) o d.2.2,
    (\ x ax o d -> uo-at A g x d.1 ax d.2.1 (mx3 A (ag-ot A g) x x d.1 ax ax d.2.1) o d.2.2,
     (\ x ax o d -> uu-at A g x d.1 ax d.2.1 (mx3 A (ag-ot A g) x x d.1 ax ax d.2.1) o d.2.2,
      (\ d -> ag-back A g d.1 zero d.2.1 (rem417a A) d.2.2,
       \ d -> ui-at A g d.1 d.2.1 d.2.2))))) ;

rem423a (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : DC A * UC A (Dn A) = (ag-dc A g, ag-uc A g) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.23 (b)

-- z = max{k, c} in A:  W(A) n z~ = A n z~, 4.17(c), psi_k c <' k in A
psi-at (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (k c : T) (ak : A k) (ac : A c) (m : Mx A k c) (rk : Tr (isR k)) (ic : InC k c c)
  : A (psi k c) =
  ag-back A g k (psi k c) ak
    (rem417c A (ag-M A g) k c m.1 (ag-w A g k ak) (ag-w A g c ac) (ag-w A g m.1 m.2.1) m.2.2.1 m.2.2.2
       (eqv-sym (Cap A (tilde m.1)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (tilde m.1))
          (cap-le A (WA[gl].WA A) (ag-ot A g) (\ x w -> wa-OK A x w) m.1 (tilde m.1)
             (ag-ot A g m.1 m.2.1) (til-OK m.1 (ag-ot A g m.1 m.2.1)) (til-le m.1 (ag-ot A g m.1 m.2.1))
             (ag-cap A g m.1 m.2.1)))
       rk ic)
    (le-of-lt (psi k c) k (psi-lt k c (ok-psi k c rk (ag-ot A g k ak) (ag-ot A g c ac) ic))) ;

rem423b (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (k c : T) (ak : A k) (ac : A c) (rk : Tr (isR k)) (ic : InC k c c) : A (psi k c) =
  psi-at A g k c ak ac (max2 A (ag-ot A g) k c ak ac) rk ic ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.23 (c)

-- transport along y = u (explicit arguments)
tr-Bs (B : Cl) (u y : T) (e : Id T y u) (b : B u) : B y = subst (\ s -> B s) (sym e) b ;
le-eq (y u : T) (e : Id T y u) : Tr (le y u) = le-l u y u (sym e) (le-refl u) ;

-- A c A+, x+ in A+
ap-sub (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Sub A (Aplus A) =
  \ x ax -> (x, (ax, inl (ag-w A g x ax, lt-up x (ag-ot A g x ax)))) ;
ap-up (A : Cl) (x : T) (ax : A x) : Aplus A (up x) = (x, (ax, inr (refl (up x)))) ;

-- A+ c OT
ap-ok (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Sub (Aplus A) OTc =
  \ y h -> either (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up h.1) y) (Id T y (up h.1)) (OK y)
             (\ q -> wa-OK A y q.1)
             (\ e -> tr-Bs OTc (up h.1) y e (up-OK h.1 (ag-ot A g h.1 h.2.1))) h.2.2 ;

-- z in A  =>  z+ in M(A):  C^{z+}(A) upward closed (4.16(a)), z in A n z+ c C^{z+}(A) (4.7(h))
up-M (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (z : T) (az : A z) : M A (up z) =
  (up-OK z (ag-ot A g z az),
   uc-up (C (up z) A) OTc
     (rem416a-C A (ag-M A g) (up z) (up-OK z (ag-ot A g z az))
        (wd-cap A (ag-ot A g) (tilde (up z)) (ot-T (tilde (up z)) (til-OK (up z) (up-OK z (ag-ot A g z az))))
           (dc-wd A (ag-dc A g)))).2
     z (rem47h (up z) A z (ag-ot A g z az) (az, lt-up z (ag-ot A g z az)))
     (up-OK z (ag-ot A g z az)) (up-OK z (ag-ot A g z az))) ;

-- A+ c M(A)
ap-MA (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Sub (Aplus A) (M A) =
  \ y h -> either (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up h.1) y) (Id T y (up h.1)) (M A y)
             (\ q -> wa-M A y q.1)
             (\ e -> tr-Bs (M A) (up h.1) y e (up-M A g h.1 h.2.1)) h.2.2 ;

-- A c B  =>  M(A) c M(B)  (ca-mono)
m-mono (A B : Cl) (h : Sub A B) : Sub (M A) (M B) =
  \ y m -> (m.1, ca-mono y A B (\ z q -> (h z q.1, q.2)) y m.2) ;

-- A+ c M(A+)
ap-M (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Sub (Aplus A) (M (Aplus A)) =
  \ y h -> m-mono A (Aplus A) (ap-sub A g) y (ap-MA A g y h) ;

-- a cardinal q = Omega_s below t+ is <=' t~  (q <=' q~ <=' t~, card-le, til-up)
card-below (q s t : T) (os : OK s) (e : Id T q (omF s)) (oq : OK q) (ot : OK t) (l : LT q (up t)) : Tr (le q (tilde t)) =
  le-trans q (tilde q) (tilde t) (trOT q (tilde q) (tilde t) oq (til-OK q oq) (til-OK t ot))
    (card-le q s os e q oq (le-refl q)) (til-up q t oq ot l) ;

-- z, x in A, z+ <' x+  =>  z+ in A:  z+ = Omega_{s+1} <=' x~ in A (4.23(a))
up-below-at (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x z : T) (ax : A x) (az : A z) (ox : OK x) (oz : OK z) (l : LT (up z) (up x)) : A (up z) =
  uc-up A (Dn A) (ag-uc A g) z az (up-OK z oz)
    (tilde x, ((dc-card A (ag-dc A g) x ax).1,
               card-below (up z) (suc (rem214f z oz).1) x (suc-OK (rem214f z oz).1 (rem214f z oz).2.1)
                 (rem214f z oz).2.2.2.1 (up-OK z oz) ox l)) ;
up-below (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x z : T) (ax : A x) (az : A z) (l : LT (up z) (up x)) : A (up z) =
  up-below-at A g x z ax az (ag-ot A g x ax) (ag-ot A g z az) l ;

-- y in A+, y <' x+, x in A  =>  y in W(A)
ap-w (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x y : T) (ax : A x) (h : Aplus A y) (l : LT y (up x)) : WA[gl].WA A y =
  either (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up h.1) y) (Id T y (up h.1)) (WA[gl].WA A y)
    (\ q -> q.1)
    (\ e -> tr-Bs (WA[gl].WA A) (up h.1) y e
              (ag-w A g (up h.1) (up-below A g x h.1 ax h.2.1 (lt-l y (up h.1) (up x) e l)))) h.2.2 ;

-- x in A  =>  A+ n x+ = W(A) n x+
ap-cap (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) : Eqv (Cap (Aplus A) (up x)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up x)) =
  \ y -> (\ q -> (ap-w A g x y ax q.1 q.2, q.2),
          \ q -> ((x, (ax, inl q)), q.2)) ;

-- x in A  =>  A n x~ = A+ n x~
til-eq (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) : Eqv (Cap A (tilde x)) (Cap (Aplus A) (tilde x)) =
  \ y -> (\ q -> (ap-sub A g y q.1, q.2),
          \ q -> (ag-back A g x y ax
                    (ap-w A g x y ax q.1
                       (lt-le y (tilde x) (up x)
                          (trOT y (tilde x) (up x) (ap-ok A g y q.1) (til-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)) (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)))
                          q.2 (le-of-lt (tilde x) (up x)
                                 (le-lt (tilde x) x (up x)
                                    (trOT (tilde x) x (up x) (til-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)) (ag-ot A g x ax) (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)))
                                    (til-le x (ag-ot A g x ax)) (lt-up x (ag-ot A g x ax))))))
                    (le-of-lt y x (lt-le y (tilde x) x
                                     (trOT y (tilde x) x (ap-ok A g y q.1) (til-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)) (ag-ot A g x ax))
                                     q.2 (til-le x (ag-ot A g x ax)))),
                  q.2)) ;

-- A n a = B n a, a = b  =>  A n b = B n b
cap-tr (A B : Cl) (a b : T) (e : Id T a b) (h : Eqv (Cap A a) (Cap B a)) : Eqv (Cap A b) (Cap B b) =
  subst (\ c -> Eqv (Cap A c) (Cap B c)) e h ;
cap-trs (A B : Cl) (a b : T) (e : Id T b a) (h : Eqv (Cap A a) (Cap B a)) : Eqv (Cap A b) (Cap B b) =
  subst (\ c -> Eqv (Cap A c) (Cap B c)) (sym e) h ;

-- x~ = Omega_s, x+ = Omega_{s+1}:  W(A) n x+ = W(A+) n x+  (4.13(b))
wap-at (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) (s : T) (os : OK s)
  (e1 : Id T (tilde x) (omF s)) (e2 : Id T (up x) (omF (suc s)))
  : Eqv (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up x)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x)) =
  cap-trs (WA[gl].WA A) (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (omF (suc s)) (up x) e2
    (rem413b A (Aplus A) s os (cap-tr A (Aplus A) (tilde x) (omF s) e1 (til-eq A g x ax)) (ag-M A g) (ap-M A g)).2 ;

wap-ok (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) (ox : OK x)
  : Eqv (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up x)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x)) =
  wap-at A g x ax (rem214f x ox).1 (rem214f x ox).2.1 (rem214f x ox).2.2.1 (rem214f x ox).2.2.2.1 ;
wap (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) : Eqv (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up x)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x)) =
  wap-ok A g x ax (ag-ot A g x ax) ;

eqv-trans (A B D : Cl) (e1 : Eqv A B) (e2 : Eqv B D) : Eqv A D =
  \ y -> (\ q -> fw (B y) (D y) (e2 y) (fw (A y) (B y) (e1 y) q),
          \ q -> bw (A y) (B y) (e1 y) (bw (B y) (D y) (e2 y) q)) ;

-- x in A  =>  A+ n x+ = W(A+) n x+
ap-cap2 (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) : Eqv (Cap (Aplus A) (up x)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x)) =
  eqv-trans (Cap (Aplus A) (up x)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up x)) (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x))
    (ap-cap A g x ax) (wap A g x ax) ;

-- the hypotheses of 4.17(b) for A+ at x+
ap-h17 (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) : H17 (Aplus A) (up x) =
  (ap-M A g, (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax), ap-cap2 A g x ax)) ;

-- x in A  =>  x+ in W(A+):  x in W(A+) n x++, upward closed bounded by x++ (4.17(b))
ap-wup (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) : WA[gl].WA (Aplus A) (up x) =
  (uc-up (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up (up x))) (Bnd (up (up x)))
     (rem417b (Aplus A) (up x) (ap-h17 A g x ax)).2 x
     ((fw (Cap (Aplus A) (up x) x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x) x) (ap-cap2 A g x ax x)
          (ap-sub A g x ax, lt-up x (ag-ot A g x ax))).1,
      tr3 x (up x) (up (up x)) (ot-T x (ag-ot A g x ax)) (ot-T (up x) (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)))
        (ot-T (up (up x)) (up-OK (up x) (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax))))
        (lt-up x (ag-ot A g x ax)) (lt-up (up x) (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax))))
     (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)) (lt-up (up x) (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)))).1 ;

-- y <=' x+, x in A  =>  (y in A+ <=> y in W(A+))
ap-le (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) (y : T) (l : Tr (le y (up x))) : Iff (Aplus A y) (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A) y) =
  orE (Iff (Aplus A y) (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A) y)) (lt y (up x)) (eqT y (up x)) l
    (\ p -> (\ h -> (fw (Cap (Aplus A) (up x) y) (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x) y) (ap-cap2 A g x ax y) (h, p)).1,
             \ w -> (bw (Cap (Aplus A) (up x) y) (Cap (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x) y) (ap-cap2 A g x ax y) (w, p)).1))
    (\ q -> (\ h -> tr-Bs (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) (up x) y (eqT-sound y (up x) q) (ap-wup A g x ax),
             \ w -> tr-Bs (Aplus A) (up x) y (eqT-sound y (up x) q) (ap-up A x ax))) ;

-- z in A+ is <=' x+ for its x in A
ap-zle (A : Cl) (z : T) (h : Aplus A z) : Tr (le z (up h.1)) =
  either (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) (up h.1) z) (Id T z (up h.1)) (Tr (le z (up h.1)))
    (\ q -> le-of-lt z (up h.1) q.2)
    (\ e -> le-eq z (up h.1) e) h.2.2 ;

-- y <' z+1, z <=' u  =>  y <=' u
le-sy (y z u : T) (oy : OK y) (oz : OK z) (ou : OK u) (l1 : LT y (suc z)) (l2 : Tr (le z u)) : Tr (le y u) =
  le-trans y z u (trOT y z u oy oz ou) (lt-suc-le' y z oy oz l1) l2 ;

-- z <=' x+, x in A  =>  A+|z = W(A+)|z
ap-bar (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) (x : T) (ax : A x) (z : T) (oz : OK z) (lz : Tr (le z (up x))) (y : T)
  : Iff (Bar (Aplus A) z y) (Bar (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A)) z y) =
  (\ q -> (fw (Aplus A y) (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A) y)
             (ap-le A g x ax y (le-sy y z (up x) (ap-ok A g y q.1) oz (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)) q.2 lz)) q.1, q.2),
   \ q -> (bw (Aplus A y) (WA[gl].WA (Aplus A) y)
             (ap-le A g x ax y (le-sy y z (up x) (wa-OK (Aplus A) y q.1) oz (up-OK x (ag-ot A g x ax)) q.2 lz)) q.1, q.2)) ;

-- Ag(A+)
ap-ag (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Ag (Aplus A) =
  (ap-ok A g, \ z h y -> ap-bar A g h.1 h.2.1 z (ap-ok A g z h) (ap-zle A z h) y) ;

rem423c (A : Cl) (g : Ag A) : Ag (Aplus A) * (Sub A (Aplus A) * ((x : T) -> A x -> Aplus A (up x))) =
  (ap-ag A g, (ap-sub A g, ap-up A)) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.24

-- the class {x | x <=' z}
BndE (z x : T) : U gl = Tr (le x z) ;

-- A n x = B n x  =>  C^x(A) = C^x(B)  (ca-mono both ways)
ca-cap (A B : Cl) (x : T) (e : Eqv (Cap A x) (Cap B x)) : Eqv (C x A) (C x B) =
  \ y -> (ca-mono x A B (\ u q -> fw (Cap A x u) (Cap B x u) (e u) q) y,
          ca-mono x B A (\ u q -> bw (Cap A x u) (Cap B x u) (e u) q) y) ;

-- transfer:  A, B c OT, A n z = B n z, x in W(A), x <=' z  =>  x in W(B)
wa-at (A B : Cl) (oA : Sub A OTc) (oB : Sub B OTc) (z : T) (oz : OK z) (e : Eqv (Cap A z) (Cap B z))
  : (x : T) -> WA[gl].WA A x -> BndE z x -> WA[gl].WA B x =
  wa-agree A B (BndE z)
    (\ x m l -> ca-cap A B x (cap-le A B oA oB z x oz m.1 l e))
    (\ x y m l t -> le-of-lt y z (lt-le y x z (trOT y x z (ca-ok x A y t.1) m.1 oz) t.2 l)) ;

-- A = W(A) n a  =>  Ag(A)
eq-ag (A : Cl) (a : T) (oa : OK a) (e : Eqv A (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) a)) : Ag A =
  (\ x h -> wa-OK A x (fw (A x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) a x) (e x) h).1,
   \ x h y -> (\ q -> ((fw (A y) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) a y) (e y) q.1).1, q.2),
               \ q -> (bw (A y) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) a y) (e y)
                         (q.1, le-lt y x a (trOT y x a (wa-OK A y q.1) (wa-OK A x (fw (A x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) a x) (e x) h).1) oa)
                                 (lt-suc-le' y x (wa-OK A y q.1) (wa-OK A x (fw (A x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) a x) (e x) h).1) q.2)
                                 (fw (A x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A) a x) (e x) h).2), q.2))) ;

-- the hypotheses: A_i = W(A_i) n a_i, a_i in OT, a_0 <=' a_1
H24 (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) : U gl =
  OK a0 * (OK a1 * (Eqv A0 (Cap (WA[gl].WA A0) a0) * (Eqv A1 (Cap (WA[gl].WA A1) a1) * Tr (le a0 a1)))) ;
h-oa0 (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : OK a0 = h.1 ;
h-oa1 (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : OK a1 = h.2.1 ;
h-e0 (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : Eqv A0 (Cap (WA[gl].WA A0) a0) = h.2.2.1 ;
h-e1 (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : Eqv A1 (Cap (WA[gl].WA A1) a1) = h.2.2.2.1 ;
h-le (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : Tr (le a0 a1) = h.2.2.2.2 ;
h-ag0 (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : Ag A0 = eq-ag A0 a0 (h-oa0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) (h-e0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) ;
h-ag1 (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : Ag A1 = eq-ag A1 a1 (h-oa1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) (h-e1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) ;

-- the side step at z in A_1, z <' b:  A_0 n z = A_1 n z, so z in W(A_0) n a_0
side-at (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) (b : T) (ob : OK b) (lb : Tr (le b a0))
  (hb : Sub (Cap A0 b) A1) (z : T) (az : A1 z) (ih : Sub (Cap A1 z) (Imp (Bnd b) A0)) (lz : LT z b) : A0 z =
  bw (A0 z) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A0) a0 z) (h-e0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h z)
    (wa-at A1 A0 (ag-ot A1 (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h)) (ag-ot A0 (h-ag0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h)) z (ag-ot A1 (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) z az)
       (\ y -> (\ q -> (ih y q (trOT y z b (ag-ot A1 (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) y q.1) (ag-ot A1 (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) z az) ob q.2 lz), q.2),
                \ q -> (hb y (q.1, trOT y z b (ag-ot A0 (h-ag0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) y q.1) (ag-ot A1 (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) z az) ob q.2 lz), q.2)))
       z (ag-w A1 (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) z az) (le-refl z),
     lt-le z b a0 (trOT z b a0 (ag-ot A1 (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) z az) ob (h-oa0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h)) lz lb) ;

-- side:  b <=' a_0, A_0 n b c A_1  =>  A_1 n b c A_0   (4.21(a) on A_1)
side (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) (b : T) (ob : OK b) (lb : Tr (le b a0))
  (hb : Sub (Cap A0 b) A1) : Sub (Cap A1 b) A0 =
  \ z q -> rem421a A1 (Imp (Bnd b) A0) (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) (side-at A0 A1 a0 a1 h b ob lb hb) z q.1 q.2 ;

-- the main step at x in A_0:  A_0 n x = A_1 n x, so x in W(A_1) n a_1
main-at (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) (x : T) (ax : A0 x) (ih : Sub (Cap A0 x) A1) : A1 x =
  bw (A1 x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A1) a1 x) (h-e1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h x)
    (wa-at A0 A1 (ag-ot A0 (h-ag0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h)) (ag-ot A1 (h-ag1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h)) x (ag-ot A0 (h-ag0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) x ax)
       (\ y -> (\ q -> (ih y q, q.2),
                \ q -> (side A0 A1 a0 a1 h x (ag-ot A0 (h-ag0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) x ax)
                          (le-of-lt x a0 (fw (A0 x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A0) a0 x) (h-e0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h x) ax).2) ih y q, q.2)))
       x (ag-w A0 (h-ag0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) x ax) (le-refl x),
     lt-le x a0 a1 (trOT x a0 a1 (ag-ot A0 (h-ag0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) x ax) (h-oa0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) (h-oa1 A0 A1 a0 a1 h))
       (fw (A0 x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A0) a0 x) (h-e0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h x) ax).2 (h-le A0 A1 a0 a1 h)) ;

-- A_0 c A_1  (4.21(a) on A_0)
main (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : Sub A0 A1 =
  rem421a A0 A1 (h-ag0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) (main-at A0 A1 a0 a1 h) ;

rem424 (A0 A1 : Cl) (a0 a1 : T) (h : H24 A0 A1 a0 a1) : Eqv A0 (Cap A1 a0) =
  \ x -> (\ a -> (main A0 A1 a0 a1 h x a, (fw (A0 x) (Cap (WA[gl].WA A0) a0 x) (h-e0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h x) a).2),
          \ q -> side A0 A1 a0 a1 h a0 (h-oa0 A0 A1 a0 a1 h) (le-refl a0) (\ y r -> main A0 A1 a0 a1 h y r.1) x q) ;
